{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"余纤维列"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"“余纤维列”"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>在一个"},{"Local":{"url":"无穷范畴","text":"无穷范畴"}},{"Plain":"中, 设 $0$ 为零对象, 称序列 $A\\to B\\to C$ 为余纤维列是指\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}{ccc}\r\n\tA &amp; \\to &amp; B\\\\\r\n\t\\downarrow &amp;&amp; \\downarrow\\\\\r\n\t0 &amp; \\to &amp; C\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n为推出.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"纤维列","text":"纤维列"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"稳定∞-范畴","text":"稳定无穷范畴"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}